{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18100","headline":"奉和武相公镇蜀时咏使宅韦太尉所养孔雀 · 韩愈","name":"奉和武相公镇蜀时咏使宅韦太尉所养孔雀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穆穆鸾凤友，何年来止兹。\n飘零失故态，隔绝抱长思。\n翠角高独耸，金华焕相差。\n坐蒙恩顾重，毕命守堦墀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18100.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18100","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}